# oracle: pair_style born/coul/msm (Born-Mayer-Huggins with the MSM short-range Coulomb term, always evaluated directly: no tables) with kspace_style msm defaults (order 10, cutoff/adjust yes, pressure/scalar yes: the Born forces alone in the fdotr virial plus E_coul/3), rocksalt NaCl parameters, NVE, 40 steps.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 5.0e-13, atoms 5.0e-14.
units           metal
atom_style      charge
lattice         fcc 5.64
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
lattice         fcc 5.64 origin 0.5 0.0 0.0
create_atoms    2 box
mass            1 22.99
mass            2 35.45
set             type 1 charge 1.0
set             type 2 charge -1.0
variable        dx atom 0.12*sin(0.53*x+0.21*y)
variable        dy atom 0.12*cos(0.37*y-0.19*z)
variable        dz atom 0.12*sin(0.29*z+0.41*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
variable        vx atom 2.0*sin(0.7*x+0.3*z)
variable        vy atom 2.0*cos(0.5*y+0.2*x)
variable        vz atom 2.0*sin(0.4*z-0.6*y)
velocity        all set v_vx v_vy v_vz units box
velocity        all zero linear
pair_style      born/coul/msm 7.0
pair_coeff      1 1 0.263690 0.317 2.340 1.048553 -0.49935
pair_coeff      1 2 0.210984 0.317 2.755 6.99055 -8.6757
pair_coeff      2 2 0.158221 0.317 3.170 75.0544 -150.7325
kspace_style    msm 1.0e-4
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe evdwl ecoul elong etotal press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             40
